      "en": "When the living creatures give glory, honor, and thanks to him who sits on the throne, to him who lives forever and ever,",
      "ko": "그 생물들이 영광과 존귀와 감사를 보좌에 앉으사 세세토록 사시는 이에게 돌릴 때에",
      "source_text_hash": "bca5f545d4047849c920cce082d3f3c407b6f7ae5f45c91f90e2c8fa79f235fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "43f03e903fd74fb43121f3f3024862e539768e84de2839ce5192265b2fda2505",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
